  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>Chaos dragons swim through the churning soup of Limbo, where matter takes whatever shape a strong will gives it. Their scales ripple through every color in turn, and their moods change as quickly. They hoard nothing for long; a chaos dragon's lair is a heap of treasures it has forgotten it wanted.</p><p><em>Unofficial 5e conversion of a dragon from an earlier edition of the game, for the Legacy Dragons module.</em></p>",
