   "name": "Breath Weapons",
   "type": "feat",
   "img": "icons/skills/toxins/cauldron-bubbles-overflow-green.webp",
   "system": {
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} uses one of the following breath weapons.</p><p><strong>Chaos Breath.</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} exhales a burst of raw chaos in a [[lookup @labels.description.template activity=qS7H0MYyT4BQEwyj]]. Each creature in that area must make a [[/save activity=qS7H0MYyT4BQEwyj]] saving throw, taking [[/damage average activity=qS7H0MYyT4BQEwyj]] damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The damage type is random: roll a d6 (1 acid, 2 cold, 3 fire, 4 lightning, 5 thunder, 6 the dragon chooses).</p><p><strong>Confusion Breath.</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} unleashes its confusion Breath in a [[lookup @labels.description.template activity=wtPFAJPCIg2qJLb4]]. Each creature in that area must succeed on a [[/save activity=wtPFAJPCIg2qJLb4]] saving throw or be unable to tell friend from foe until the end of its next turn. On its turn it rolls a d4: 1 it does nothing, 2 it moves in a random direction, 3-4 it attacks a random creature in reach, or does nothing if there is none.</p>",
     "chat": ""
